# What `fly deploy` must not upload. Secrets come from `fly secrets`, never
# from a file baked into the image.
#
# For buildpack builds flyctl matches these anywhere in the tree, leading `/`
# or not, so never list a name that also appears under src/ — `uploads` here
# dropped src/uploads and broke the build. (The local uploads/ fallback folder
# is empty and harmless to ship.)
/.env
/.env.*
!/.env.example
/node_modules
/dist
/coverage
/test
*.log
